{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Commencer", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Mes choses pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9es", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 1, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "L'apprenant fait usage de l'information \u00e9l\u00e9mentaire concernant les gens, leurs go\u00fbts et leurs d\u00e9go\u00fbts, leur lieu de r\u00e9sidence ou leur pays, dans des situations communicatives.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Parler de l'heure", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Vous utilisez ces mots pour parler d'une partie de la journ\u00e9e :<br/><span class = \"strong\"> du matin</span> - de 5 h 00 \u00e0 11 h 00<br/><span class = \"strong\">de l'apr\u00e8s-midi</span> - de 12 h 00* \u00e0 17 h 00<br/><span class = \"strong\">du soir</span> - de  18 h 00 \u00e0 00 h 00 <br/><br/>*12 h 00 c'est l'heure du d\u00e9jeuner (<span class = \"italic\">midi</span>).<br/>00 h 00  c'est le milieu de la nuit (<span class = \"italic\">minuit</span>).<br/><br/>Vous utilisez ces mots pour parler d'une partie de la semaine :<br/><span class = \"strong\">les jours de la semaine</span> - lundi \u00e0 vendredi<br/><span class = \"strong\">week-end</span> - samedi et dimanche<br/><br/>Ces mots peuvent s'accorder au pluriel pour exprimer une chose que vous faites r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "La biblioth\u00e8que est ferm\u00e9e les lundis.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Le restaurant est ouvert les week-ends.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Je travaille les samedis.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Parler de ce que vous aimez ou de ce que vous n'aimez pas", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Vous utilisez le pr\u00e9sent de l'indicatif pour parler de ce que vous aimez ou de ce que vous n'aimez pas. <br/><br/><span class = \"underline\">Expressions positives</span> :<br/>J'aime...<br/>Je suis fan de...<br/>J'adore...<br/><br/><span class = \"underline\">Expressions n\u00e9gatives</span> :<br/>Je n'aime pas...<br/>Je d\u00e9teste...<br/>Je ne supporte pas...", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "J'adore la cuisine japonaise !", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Je n'aime pas tellement la cuisine mexicaine.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Je ne supporte pas les petites olives.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "ouvert, ouverte", "type": "name"}, {"content": "qui n'est pas ferm\u00e9", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Est-ce que le restaurant est ouvert le lundi ?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Vous utilisez ces mots quand vous allez rencontrer une personne.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "la faim", "type": "name"}, {"content": "d\u00e9sir de manger", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'ai faim. Vous mangez \u00e0 quelle heure&#x202F;?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "parfait, parfaite", "type": "name"}, {"content": "qui a toutes les qualit\u00e9s que l'on attend de lui", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Le g\u00e2teau est parfait.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "g\u00e9nial, g\u00e9niale", "type": "name"}, {"content": "qui est tr\u00e8s bien", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ce film est g\u00e9nial !", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le week-end", "type": "name"}, {"content": "samedi et dimanche", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je vais manger des sushis ce week-end.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "rencontrer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "croiser quelqu'un ; faire la connaissance de quelqu'un ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'ai rencontr\u00e9 Pierre \u00e0 la librairie.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "\u00eatre fan de", "type": "name"}, {"content": "aimer beaucoup quelque chose ou quelqu'un", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je suis fan des croissants.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "gros, grosse", "type": "name"}, {"content": "qui d\u00e9passe la moyenne en volume ou en \u00e9paisseur", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'aime les gros sushis.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob10aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "petit, petite", "type": "name"}, {"content": "de faible dimension", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'aime les petites olives.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob10aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "\u00c9crivez 3-4 choses  que vous faites dans une journ\u00e9e normale.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Indiquez l'heure.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Comparez votre liste \u00e0 celle de votre partenaire.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez 2 phrases. Commencez vos phrases avec l'heure de la journ\u00e9e comme par exemple : \"Le matin, nous...\"", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Lisez vos phrases \u00e0 voix haute.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Je parle de mes activit\u00e9s quotidiennes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je parle des moments de la journ\u00e9e.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je pose des questions sur les routines des autres.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "frn2le01ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "frn2le01ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Aimes-tu la cuisine mexicaine, Jean ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Non, je n'aime pas vraiment la cuisine mexicaine. C'est trop \u00e9pic\u00e9."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "6250", "id": 2, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Et la cuisine grecque ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Ah non. Je ne supporte pas les petites olives."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob10re2img01.jpg", "time": "10500", "id": 3, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Bon ben, la cuisine japonaise, alors ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Ah oui, j'adore la cuisine japonaise. Pourquoi ?"}, {"image": "frn2le01ob10re2img01.jpg", "time": "16600", "id": 4, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Mon anniversaire est mercredi prochain. Est-ce que tu veux aller chez Sushi Ya ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Ah pourquoi pas ! C'est mon restaurant pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9. Je suis un fan de leur gros sushi au thon, mais je n'aime pas la soupe."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob10re2img01.jpg", "time": "28000", "id": 5, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : J'adore tout sur leur menu.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Oh attends !  Ils sont ferm\u00e9s dans la semaine."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "33000", "id": 6, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Est-ce que c'est ouvert le week-end ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Oui, le restaurant est ouvert le midi et le soir pendant le week-end."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "38750", "id": 7, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : G\u00e9nial ! Allons-y samedi soir.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Ok ! Trop g\u00e9nial. On se rencontre \u00e0 7 heures du soir."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "45750", "id": 8, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : 7 heures du soir, \u00e7a marche !<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : G\u00e9nial ! Maintenant j'ai faim !"}], "audiosrc": "frn2le01ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn2le01ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Je peux parler des moments de la journ\u00e9e.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux parler de mes pr\u00e9f\u00e9rences.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux m'exprimer sur ce que j'aime et ce que je n'aime pas.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Qu'aimez-vous faire le samedi et le dimanche&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Que d\u00e9testez-vous faire pendant la semaine&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "J'adore les sushis mais  je ne suis pas une fan de la soupe&nbsp;! Et toi&nbsp;?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Charlotte organise son anniversaire avec Jean. Qui est  <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">fan</span> de sushi ? ", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt